operation Teleport(msg : Qubit, here : Qubit, there : Qubit) : Unit {
    // here/there start as an entangled Bell pair
    H(here);
    CNOT(here, there);

    // Bell-basis change on msg and here
    CNOT(msg, here);
    H(msg);

    let m1 = M(msg);
    let m2 = M(here);

    if m2 == One { X(there); }
    if m1 == One { Z(there); }
}

each of the 4 possible (m1, m2) outcomes: P = 0.25 exactly

for every outcome, applying its indicated correction (X and/or Z)
reproduces the original state with fidelity exactly 1.0
